-- הסכם קיבוצי — טבלת השכר למורים, הפעימה השלישית של תוספת 2011
-- (15.4.2013): the third part of the 2011 public-sector cost framework for
-- teaching employees in the State's service. The completion agreement of
-- 29.2.2012 (§92(ב)) put off the allocation due in January 2013 to April
-- 2013 and cut it to complete the rate to 5.75%; this agreement makes it.
-- From 1.4.2013, for Ofek Hadash teachers and for the supervision and
-- headquarters staff of the agreement of 5.7.2010, the salary tables stand
-- 5.75% above the tables in force before the update of 1.1.2011, and the
-- updated tables are its thirty-four annexes (א'1–א'26 and ב'1–ב'8); for
-- the teachers off the reform, the 2011 supplement is paid at 5.75% and the
-- shekel supplements stand 5.75% above their sums before 1.1.2011. It
-- exhausts the base agreement's §155(א) for the third part of the cost
-- framework.
--
-- The annexes are DATA: every table is written here cell for cell as the
-- corpus publishes it, in the shape the agreement of 25.1.2011 (the first
-- part) gave its tables — a list of the base agreement's §46 `grade cell`s
-- per row — and with that agreement's types and checks, imported. The
-- checks at the end run, over every cell, what the agreement says a table
-- should be: 5.75% over the tables before 1.1.2011, which the corpus does
-- not hold, set beside the first part's tables at 2.25% over the same
-- tables; the first deputies' tables at 85% of the principals' (the
-- completion agreement's §56) and the conversion-only tables at 75% (the
-- base agreement's §92(א)); the conversion tables as the same tables with
-- intermediate grades; and the steps each table prints.
--
-- Imported where this agreement applies or amends them: the first part
-- (its tables, its 2011 supplement and shekel supplements, which this
-- agreement raises, dated); the completion agreement of 29.2.2012 (the
-- January 2013 allocation it put off and cut, the 4% in force on the eve,
-- the 85% share, and the framework parts its §92 settles); and the base
-- agreement's §§2, 35, 46, 92 and 155. The framework agreement of 12.1.2011
-- is encoded at l4/agreements/framework/2011-01-12_framework-agreement_public-sector_tosefet-2011.l4
-- and not imported here: what this agreement takes from it, the recitals
-- and §92(ב) state in their own words. Its amendment of 11.4.2011, which
-- the recitals name, is imported: the day it was signed, and the rate
-- §5.1.3 completes to as amended, which the third part's cut is measured
-- against. The supervision agreement of 5.7.2010 the corpus does not hold.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-2`
IMPORT `2011-01-25_ofek-hadash_tosefet-2011-first-part_tables`
IMPORT `2012-02-29_ofek-hadash_amendment_hascam-hashlama`
IMPORT `2011-04-11_framework-agreement_public-sector_amendment`

§ `הסכם תוספת 2011, הפעימה השלישית — 15.4.2013`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 A fax header; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The Registrar's stamp: registered on 21.07.2013 as no. 123/2013; no rule of the agreement.

-- The day of signing, written in by hand.
@ref akn:preamble/p4
`the day the third part was signed` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 15 4 2013

-- The parties: the State, by the Treasury's wages commissioner and the
-- Ministry of Education's director-general, and the teachers' union, by its
-- secretary-general.
@ref akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9
`the third part's parties` MEANS LIST `the State`, `the teachers' union`

-- akn:preamble/p7 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 "On the other side"; no rule.

-- The first recital: the base agreement (25.12.08) bound the parties to
-- negotiate applying to teaching employees the cost of framework agreements
-- signed later (its §155(א)), which keeps a framework agreement's cost open.
@ref akn:preamble/p11
`the third part's recital on section 155(א)` MEANS
    `may be negotiated` `the cost of a framework agreement`

-- The second: they negotiated on the framework agreement of 12.1.2011, as
-- amended on 11.4.2011 ("הסכם המסגרת"); the amendment's day as the
-- recital states it, held below to the day the amendment (imported) was
-- signed.
@ref akn:preamble/p12
`the framework agreement was amended on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 11 4 2011

-- The third: §92(ב) of the completion agreement of 29.2.2012 put the
-- allocation due in January 2013 off by three months, to April 2013 ("עלות
-- הפעימה השלישית"), and cut it by 0.5% against the rate of §5.1.3 of the
-- framework agreement, so that it completes the rate to 5.75%. The recital
-- states what the completion agreement already says; the checks below hold
-- the two together.
@ref akn:preamble/p13
`the third part's cost is allocated from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2013

@ref akn:preamble/p13
`the rate the third part completes` MEANS 5.75%

@ref akn:preamble/p13
`the cut of the third part's cost` MEANS 0.5%

-- akn:preamble/p14 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

§§ `1 כללי`

-- The preamble and the annexes are an inseparable part of the agreement:
-- the thirty-four tables below are the agreement's, as §4(א) applies them.
@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p1
GIVEN p IS A `part of the agreement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is an inseparable part of the third part` p IF
    TRUE

§§ `2 לשון`

-- The masculine includes the feminine and the plural, and the reverse,
-- unless said otherwise expressly: the base agreement's §2, word for word.
@ref akn:art_2
GIVEN `written in` IS A `form of a word`, `read in` IS A `form of a word`, `expressly limited` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a word of the third part reads in another form` `written in` `read in` `expressly limited` IF
    `a word written in one form reads in another` `written in` `read in` `expressly limited`

-- akn:art_2/p2 A fax header; no rule.
-- akn:art_2/p3 The page number; no rule.

§§ `3 תחולה`

-- Every employee in the State's service graded on the teaching-staff grade
-- ("עובדי הוראה"): the first part's `employee`, whom its §3 reaches in the
-- same words.
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the third part applies to` e IF
        e's `graded on the teaching-staff grade`
    AND e's `employed in the State's service`

§§ `4 הקצאת העלות`

-- ¶1: the third part's cost is applied as (א) and (ב) say, by the
-- employee's terms (the first part's division of them).
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`
GIVETH A MAYBE `way of the allocation`
DECIDE `how the third part reaches` e IS
    IF NOT `the third part applies to` e
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE CONSIDER e's `terms`
         WHEN `the reform's terms` THEN JUST `the salary tables updated`
         WHEN `a supervision or headquarters role` THEN JUST `the salary tables updated`
         WHEN `the terms off the reform` THEN JUST `the 2011 supplement and the shekel supplements updated`

-- (א): for the reform's teachers, and for the supervision and headquarters
-- staff of the agreement of 5.7.2010, the salary tables are updated from
-- 1.4.2013 so that their total update over the tables in force on the eve
-- of the update of 1.1.2011 is 5.75% — the completion agreement's §92(א)(1)
-- measured its 4% of 1.1.2012 the same way.
@ref akn:art_4__para_a
`the third part's tables are updated from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2013

@ref akn:art_4__para_a
`the total update of the reform tables from 1.4.2013` MEANS 5.75%

@ref akn:art_4__para_a
GIVEN `a cell before the update of 1.1.2011` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a reform table cell from 1.4.2013, by the total update` `a cell before the update of 1.1.2011` IS
    `a cell before the update of 1.1.2011` `increased by` `the total update of the reform tables from 1.4.2013`

-- The same update as one more dated update of the base agreement's tables
-- (§35(ב)): on 1.4.2013, the rate that takes the tables from the 4% in
-- force since 1.1.2012 (the completion agreement's §92(א)(1)) to 5.75%.
@ref akn:art_4__para_a
`the 1.4.2013 table update` MEANS
    `table update` WITH
        `from` IS `the third part's tables are updated from`
        `rate` IS ((1 PLUS `the total update of the reform tables from 1.4.2013`) DIVIDED BY (1 PLUS `the total update of the reform tables from 1.1.2012`)) MINUS 1

-- The updated tables are attached: א'1–א'26 for the reform's teachers,
-- ב'1–ב'8 for the supervision and headquarters staff (below).
@ref akn:art_4__para_a/p2 akn:art_4__para_a/p3
GIVEN t IS A `terms of employment`
GIVETH A LIST OF `salary table`
DECIDE `the third part's updated tables for` t IS
    CONSIDER t
    WHEN `the reform's terms` THEN `the third part's annexes א'1–א'26`
    WHEN `a supervision or headquarters role` THEN `the third part's annexes ב'1–ב'8`
    WHEN `the terms off the reform` THEN EMPTY

-- (ב): for the teachers employed under the collective agreements off the
-- reform (and, the text adds, not in a supervision or headquarters role).
@ref akn:art_4__para_b
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is off the reform under the third part's 4(ב)` e IF
        `the third part applies to` e
    AND e's `terms` EQUALS `the terms off the reform`

-- (ב)(1): "the 2011 supplement" as the agreement of 25.1.2011 defines it
-- (the first part's §4(ב)(2)(א): a rate on the combined salary with the
-- 2001 and 2008 supplements) is raised from 1.4.2013 and paid at 5.75%.
-- What changes is the rate, dated; before 1.4.2013 the rate is what the
-- earlier instruments set — 2.25% from 1.1.2011 (the first part) and 4%
-- from 1.1.2012 (the completion agreement's §92(א)(2)(א)).
@ref akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_1
`the 2011 supplement rate from 1.4.2013 under the third part` MEANS 5.75%

@ref akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2011 supplement rate under the third part on` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` `the third part's tables are updated from`
    THEN `the 2011 supplement rate from 1.4.2013 under the third part`
    ELSE `the 2011 supplement rate under §92` `the 2011 supplement rate` d

-- The supplement itself is the first part's, on the same base, at the
-- rate in force on the day.
@ref akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_1
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`
      `the combined salary`  IS A NUMBER
      `the 2001 supplement`  IS A NUMBER @desc computed on a salary without the 2008 or the 2011 supplement (the first part's §4(ב)(2)(ב))
      `the 2008 supplement`  IS A NUMBER @desc computed on a salary without the 2011 supplement (the first part's §4(ב)(2)(ב))
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2011 supplement amount under the third part` e `the combined salary` `the 2001 supplement` `the 2008 supplement` d IS
    IF `is off the reform under the third part's 4(ב)` e
    THEN (`the 2011 supplement amount` e `the combined salary` `the 2001 supplement` `the 2008 supplement` d)
             TIMES (`the 2011 supplement rate under the third part on` d DIVIDED BY `the 2011 supplement rate`)
    ELSE 0

-- (ב)(2): the shekel supplements paid to these teachers are updated from
-- 1.4.2013 so that their total update over their sums on the eve of the
-- update of 1.1.2011 (under the agreement of 25.1.2011) is 5.75%. They are
-- the first part's shekel supplements (its §4(ב)(2) defines them); before
-- 1.4.2013 they are what the first part and the completion agreement
-- (§92(א)(2)(ב), 4% from 1.1.2012) make them.
@ref akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_2
`the shekel supplements' total update from 1.4.2013` MEANS 5.75%

@ref akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_2
GIVEN s IS A `shekel supplement`, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the shekel supplement under the third part on` s d IS
    BRANCH
        IF `is one of the shekel supplements` s AND d `is on or after` `the third part's tables are updated from`
        THEN (s's `amount on 31.12.2010`) `increased by` `the shekel supplements' total update from 1.4.2013`
        IF `is one of the shekel supplements` s AND d `is on or after` `1 January 2012`
        THEN `a shekel supplement from 1.1.2012` (s's `amount on 31.12.2010`)
        OTHERWISE `the shekel supplement on` s d

§§ `5 מיצוי תביעות`

-- Further to §94(א) of the completion agreement of 29.2.2012, this
-- agreement fully exhausts the base agreement's §155(א) for the third part
-- of the cost framework of the additions, §5.1.3 of the framework
-- agreement. The rest of the framework stays where §155(א) and the
-- completion agreement's §94 left it.
@ref akn:art_5 akn:art_5/p1
`the framework clause the third part exhausts` MEANS "5.1.3"

@ref akn:art_5/p1
DECLARE `part of the cost framework` IS ONE OF
    `the third part of the cost framework (section 5.1.3)`
    `another part of the cost framework`

@ref akn:art_5/p1
GIVEN p IS A `part of the cost framework`
      `days since the framework agreement was signed` IS A NUMBER
      `the parties agreed` IS A BOOLEAN
      `under the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `way of applying a framework cost`
DECIDE `how a part of the cost framework is applied after the third part` p `days since the framework agreement was signed` `the parties agreed` `under the reform` IS
    IF p EQUALS `the third part of the cost framework (section 5.1.3)`
    THEN `as the parties agreed`
    ELSE `how a framework cost is applied` `days since the framework agreement was signed` `the parties agreed` `under the reform`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 "In witness whereof"; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/t1 The parties' signature headings; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p3 The Treasury's file number; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p4 A fax header; no rule.

-- THE ANNEXES. Thirty-four tables, each written below cell for cell as the
-- corpus publishes it, in the first part's shape: a table is its rating
-- code, the grade steps its header row prints, and its rows; a row is its
-- place among the printed rows, the label it prints at its head (a
-- teachers' table's seniority, a principals' or deputies' table's
-- complexity level), the step it prints beside the label, and its cells. A
-- blank cell is not in its row; neither is a cell the corpus reads
-- [לא קריא], and the table says so where it is.
--
-- The corpus prints no annex label (א'1, א'2, …) on any table; each is
-- named here by its place, which §4(א)'s two ranges fix — twenty-six for
-- the reform's teachers, then eight for supervision and headquarters. Six
-- principals' and deputies' tables (א'9, א'18–א'21, א'23) lost their right
-- margin in the fax: the corpus notes it, the levels are not in the scan,
-- and their rows are read by their place, with NOTHING for the level —
-- never a guessed label. The principals' and deputies' grades are letters,
-- numbered as the first part numbers them: א 1, א+ 1.5, ב 2, ב+ 2.5, ג 3,
-- ג+ 3.5, ד 4.

-- Every table that prints a day under it prints "updated from 1.4.2013" —
-- save six, which print 1.1.2012 (F-ofek-hadash-tosefet-2011-third-a). The
-- four new supervision tables share a page with their conversion tables
-- and print the day once, under those.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1/p2 akn:att_3__hc_1/p2 akn:att_4__hc_1/p2 akn:att_5__hc_1/p2 akn:att_6__hc_1/p2 akn:att_7__hc_1/p2 akn:att_8__hc_1/p2 akn:att_9__hc_1/p3 akn:att_10__hc_1/p2 akn:att_11__hc_1/p2 akn:att_12__hc_1/p2 akn:att_13__hc_1/p2 akn:att_15__hc_1/p2 akn:att_17__hc_1/p2 akn:att_21__hc_1/p3 akn:att_22__hc_1/p2 akn:att_23__hc_1/p3 akn:att_25__hc_1/p2 akn:att_26__hc_1/p2 akn:att_28__hc_1/p2 akn:att_30__hc_1/p2 akn:att_32__hc_1/p2 akn:att_34__hc_1/p2
`the day most annexes print as their update` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 2013

@ref akn:att_14__hc_1/p3 akn:att_16__hc_1/p3 akn:att_18__hc_1/p4 akn:att_19__hc_1/p3 akn:att_20__hc_1/p4 akn:att_24__hc_1/p2
`the day six annexes print as their update` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012

-- The table salary on a day: the cell at the label's row and the grade,
-- from the day the tables are updated, which §4(א) sets.
GIVEN d IS A DATE, t IS A `salary table`, l IS A NUMBER, g IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the third part's table salary on` d t l g IS
    IF d `is on or after` `the third part's tables are updated from`
    THEN `the pay at grade` g (`the row labelled` t l)
    ELSE NOTHING

§§ `נספחים א'1–א'7 טבלאות השכר של המורים`

